Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 06:18:19 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:01,360] | Words: 4  | Text: 你有没有发现
Segment #2   [00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,660] | Words: 7  | Text: 随着年龄的增加
Segment #3   [00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,060] | Words: 8  | Text: 越是害怕一个人读处
Segment #4   [00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:07,020] | Words: 15 | Text: 我今天讲一个成年人最高级的认知觉醒
Segment #5   [00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,360] | Words: 10 | Text: 读处是成年人最好的休息
Segment #6   [00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,180] | Words: 8  | Text: 很多年轻人有一个误区
Segment #7   [00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,580] | Words: 6  | Text: 觉得孤单是不好的
Segment #8   [00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,800] | Words: 6  | Text: 读处是可怜的
Segment #9   [00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,000] | Words: 6  | Text: 一个人是失败的
Segment #10  [00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,260] | Words: 7  | Text: 总害怕一个人吃饭
Segment #11  [00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,100] | Words: 4  | Text: 一个人走路
Segment #12  [00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,040] | Words: 4  | Text: 一个人做事
Segment #13  [00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:18,760] | Words: 3  | Text: 一个人生活
Segment #14  [00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,680] | Words: 8  | Text: 拼命和群拼命热闹
Segment #15  [00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 拼命扎堆
Segment #16  [00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,000] | Words: 8  | Text: 哪怕圈子不适合自己
Segment #17  [00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:23,940] | Words: 5  | Text: 分为消耗自己
Segment #18  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,080] | Words: 7  | Text: 也不敢一个人读处
Segment #19  [00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,200] | Words: 9  | Text: 这是典型的低认知群体
Segment #20  [00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:27,720] | Words: 4  | Text: 依赖思维
Segment #21  [00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,020] | Words: 4  | Text: 真正成熟
Segment #22  [00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:29,120] | Words: 2  | Text: 读处
Segment #23  [00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:29,700] | Words: 2  | Text: 通透
Segment #24  [00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,400] | Words: 3  | Text: 历害的人
Segment #25  [00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,600] | Words: 12 | Text: 到了一定年纪都会借掉无效和群
Segment #26  [00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:33,960] | Words: 5  | Text: 慢慢爱上读处
Segment #27  [00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,040] | Words: 12 | Text: 我彻底讲头读处的高级认知
Segment #28  [00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,820] | Words: 7  | Text: 读处从来不是孤读
Segment #29  [00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,840] | Words: 5  | Text: 是自我沉澱
Segment #30  [00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 自我修复
Segment #31  [00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,360] | Words: 9  | Text: 自我成长的最佳时刻
Segment #32  [00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:42,720] | Words: 3  | Text: 人群里
Segment #33  [00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,760] | Words: 5  | Text: 你只能跟风
Segment #34  [00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,720] | Words: 4  | Text: 只能迎合
Segment #35  [00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:45,600] | Words: 4  | Text: 只能伪装
Segment #36  [00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,520] | Words: 4  | Text: 只能消耗
Segment #37  [00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,720] | Words: 4  | Text: 只有读处的时候
Segment #38  [00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,160] | Words: 9  | Text: 你才能真正进下心来
Segment #39  [00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,020] | Words: 3  | Text: 看清自己
Segment #40  [00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:50,780] | Words: 3  | Text: 复盘自己
Segment #41  [00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:51,660] | Words: 3  | Text: 升级自己
Segment #42  [00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:53,220] | Words: 8  | Text: 热闹只能消遣情绪
Segment #43  [00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,720] | Words: 8  | Text: 读处才能重塑人生
Segment #44  [00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:56,000] | Words: 5  | Text: 很多人的匹备
Segment #45  [00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,560] | Words: 2  | Text: 迷茫
Segment #46  [00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,140] | Words: 2  | Text: 混乱
Segment #47  [00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:57,860] | Words: 2  | Text: 浮躁
Segment #48  [00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,640] | Words: 10 | Text: 就是每天活在操杂人群里
Segment #49  [00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,200] | Words: 8  | Text: 从来没有时间和自己对话
Segment #50  [00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,620] | Words: 7  | Text: 天天看别人的生活
Segment #51  [00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:03,640] | Words: 6  | Text: 听别人的声音
